        <activityName xml:lang="en">Roundabout, AC binder layer, 15% recycling</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Roundabout, AC binder layer, 15% recycling
Modern Swiss and European technologies are applied to regional storage facilities, material extraction, and production processes. 
UUID: 73bed27d-d1bc-42a6-8897-49ac4bf9004c
This dataset documents the production, installation, deconstruction and end-of-life treatment of 1 m2 AC binder layer for a roundabout in Switzerland.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Layer thickness 85 mm, service life 30 years. 15 % recycling content
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_73bed27d-d1bc-42a6-8897-49ac4bf9004c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
